%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A7_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: My thoughts get interrupted by a familiar voice.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hi babe. I finally found you, I was so worried about you!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh, does he mean me?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I don\u2019t have a boyfriend though, so that can\u2019t be."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I turn around, confused.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And there he is. That pest from the library.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Babe, are you alright? Answer me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He comes closer, hugs me and then grabs my shoulders and shakes them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 2
      position: {x: 0, y: -200}
      speed: -1
      targetScale: 1.5
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He had a worried look on his face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph glances back and forth between us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I could basically see the question marks above his head.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "What the hell do you think you\u2019re doing right now?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try to shake Ethan off.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But he just hugs me again, tighter this time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Damn, what\u2019s he so strong for? "
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph notices my discomfort and stands up.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '{playerName}, do you know this guy? Is he bothering you?'
    alternativeText: Do you know this guy? Is he bothering you?
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Hey, back off, that\u2019s my babe!"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Stop spouting nonsense! Ethan let me go, what the hell!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just as Aleph tries to grab Ethan and pull him away, Ethan starts laughing
      and loosens his grip on me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 2
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Chill out, it was a joke. You\u2019re just so amusing {playerName}."
    alternativeText: "Chill out, it was a joke. You\u2019re just so amusing."
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 2
      type: 2
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: -1
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That wasn\u2019t funny. It seems like each time we meet you manage to
      get on my nerves."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph swiftly steps between us and scowls at Ethan.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 2
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 11
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Don\u2019t worry, we know each other. I just wanted to mess with them
      a little."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph turns to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Is that true?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I sigh with exhaustion.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Well, yeah\u2026 I guess, we do know each other."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph whispers to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Tell me if I should get him to leave, his color is a bit\u2026 weird.
      If you know what I mean."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He must be referring to his soul.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Shorty, I got something to tell ya.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He nods in Alephs direction.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And he might wanna stick around as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph and I both look at him doubtfully.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What do you want?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The envelope I gave you at the library, do you remember it? You know, the
      one I signed with my autograph?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'I shudder at the thought of that ominous letter that looked like it was
      written in blood. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It came from the envelope Ethan signed.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah, what about it?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Has something happened with that envelope or its content by chance?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: His demeanour is very unlike him, his tone very serious.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Um, I\u2019m a little confused here. Can someone fill me in on the situation?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ethan nods and explains how he met me in the library while I was doing
      research and how he gave me his autograph on that envelope in the end.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s kind of weird seeing Ethan so serious, I wonder what\u2019s
      up?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: After telling Aleph about that whole situation he turns to me again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The truth is, I saw that envelope in the bin and it had traces of a certain
      energy on it. I have studied a lot in the past and collected information on
      the Sustainer of the Dimensional Principles and how they keep the balance of
      the universes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Woah, Ethan is the studious type? I guess he has to be, at least a little
      bit, he is an author after all.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph seems invested in what he says as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am from an ancient tribe of elves and I can sense such traces of energy.
      The part about me being an elf might seem unbelievable to you, but I suspect
      this friend of yours is in a similar situation as me and can confirm that information.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I look over at Aleph and He nods.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s true, your soul doesn\u2019t seem like it originates from here.
      It\u2019s very different from all the other humans here."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Wait he\u2019s an alien too?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They both nod at my question.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You could see it that way. I can sense an unusual energy from your friend
      as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Their claims seem to work together and not contradict each other. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So if this is not just one big prank that was orchestrated by these two,
      then that must mean they are telling the truth.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "So what does that have to do with the envelope? It\u2019s true that something
      happened with the letter I found inside, but how did you know that?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Because I listened to what you said about your situation with all the strange
      things happening to you and whatnot. I suspected that you are connected to
      the Sustainer of the Dimensional Principles.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In my research I found out that the last sustainer encountered some trouble
      and vanished. And somehow that resulted in chaos, though I do not know the
      details.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You\u2019re saying the chaos might be the reason that strange things kept
      happening to me?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Yes, I think so. That\u2019s why, once I connected the dots, I found a
      way to get you in contact with that envelope, hoping to find some answers.
      Because I think you might be the successor to the last Sustainer."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b620163ea7058449903414452da40f0, type: 2}
